1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,140
Narrator：Listen to a secretary making an announcement.

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:06,190
Secretary：Hello, students and teachers.

3
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:12,050
This is a reminder that the seventh grade bake sale will be taking place today and tomorrow.

4
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:14,243
Brownies, muffins, cookies,

5
00:00:14,243 --> 00:00:17,260
and other treats will be on sale in the main lobby.

6
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:22,904
On both days, the sale will start when school finishes at 2:30

7
00:00:22,904 --> 00:00:24,230
and will go until 3:30.

8
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:30,130
The money from the bake sale will go to the seventh grade class's hiking trip.
